    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d355">

                <pb facs="0525" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1949v07p1/pg511"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC Indonesia/10–849: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Embassy in the Netherlands
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d355-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-08T18:00:00-05:00">October 8, 1949—6
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>870. Ushic 25. Hicus 52 and 53.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d355-f2"/> Neth Amb called
                    Oct 8 his request express his govt’s deep concern developments resulting from
                    your <pb facs="0526" n="512" xml:id="pg512"/> effort resolve impasse
                    ec-financial negots emphasizing possibility resignation present Cabinet and
                    breakdown RTC DepUnderSec.<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d355-f3"/> emphasized purely personal character your proposal, fact
                    that such technique had been used successfully before and expressed hope that
                    Tues meeting would resolve present tension. DepUnderSec added he did not believe
                    Neth Govt justified in making such heayy weather of incident.</p>
                <p>
                    Hicus 54<anchor n="4" xml:id="d355-f4"/>
                    received after Amb departed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d355-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d355-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated in telegram Gadel 48, October 11, 2 p. m., to New York (USUN).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d355-f2" n="2" xml:id="d355-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 907 and 908, October 8, <ref target="#pg503">pp. 503</ref>, <ref
                        target="#pg505">505</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d355-f3" n="3" xml:id="d355-f3-content">
                <p>Dean Rusk.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d355-f4" n="4" xml:id="d355-f4-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
